---
import OfferFlow from './viz/OfferFlow.astro';
import { href } from '../lib/site';
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container-x relative pt-14 pb-10 md:pt-24 md:pb-16 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_1fr] lg:items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow" data-hero style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)">Performance network with a compliance arm</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-[38px] leading-[1.06] sm:text-[48px] lg:text-[58px] font-extrabold" data-split data-hero-title>
        Built to take telehealth brands from <span class="text-teal-ink">$1M to $100M</span>.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-slate max-w-xl leading-relaxed" data-hero style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)">OnPoint is not an agency. It is a performance network with a compliance arm: verified media partners, server-side tracking, audited payouts, and every claim reviewed before it runs.</p>
      <ul class="proof mt-6" data-hero style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)">
        <li>Every partner KYC and traffic-source verified before access</li>
        <li>Server-to-server tracking; brand and partner see the same sale</li>
        <li>Payouts on approved performance, reversals visible with a reason</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3" data-hero style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)">
        <a href={href('/brands/')} class="btn btn-primary">For brands <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a href={href('/partners/')} class="btn btn-ghost">For media partners <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-mist" data-hero style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)">We do not take brands from zero to one. We scale what already works, without the risk.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:pl-4 min-w-0" data-hero style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><OfferFlow /></div>
  </div>
</section>
